---
<header class="site-header" style="position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); background: rgba(10,15,26,0.72); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px)">
<div style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px">
<a href="/#top" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; color: #F4EEE2">
<svg width="36" height="32" viewBox="-42 -32 84 74" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="-40" y="-30" width="24" height="14" rx="7" fill="#2F5BD3"></rect><rect x="-11" y="-30" width="22" height="14" rx="7" fill="#5B8CFF"></rect><rect x="16" y="-30" width="24" height="14" rx="7" fill="#8FB0FF"></rect><rect x="-7" y="-10" width="14" height="50" rx="7" fill="#F4EEE2"></rect></svg>
<span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em">TEKMERA</span>
</a>
<nav aria-label="Primary" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 28px; font-size: 15px">
<a href="/#services" style="color: #D8D1C3; text-decoration: none">Services</a>
<a href="/#industries" style="color: #D8D1C3; text-decoration: none">Industries</a>
<a href="/#products" style="color: #D8D1C3; text-decoration: none">Products</a>
<a href="/#about" style="color: #D8D1C3; text-decoration: none">About</a>
